<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">

    <meta
        name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"
    >

    <meta
        name="description"
        content="Privacy Policy for Poker Chip Counter, developed by Gega Studio."
    >

    <title>Privacy Policy | Poker Chip Counter</title>

    <style>
        :root {
            --background: #07110d;
            --surface: #0e1a15;
            --surface-light: #14241c;
            --primary: #34c759;
            --accent: #d9aa43;
            --text: #f5f7f6;
            --secondary-text: #b4beb9;
            --border: #23372d;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    circle at top,
                    #123426 0%,
                    var(--background) 42%
                );
            color: var(--text);
            font-family:
                Inter,
                -apple-system,
                BlinkMacSystemFont,
                "Segoe UI",
                Roboto,
                Arial,
                sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .container {
            width: min(900px, calc(100% - 32px));
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 48px 0;
        }

        .header {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            padding: 48px 32px;
            background: linear-gradient(
                145deg,
                rgba(24, 71, 49, 0.95),
                rgba(10, 24, 18, 0.98)
            );
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);
        }

        .app-name {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 7vw, 4rem);
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .effective-date {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--accent);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        main {
            padding: 16px 32px 32px;
            background: rgba(14, 26, 21, 0.96);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
        }

        section {
            padding: 26px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        section:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        h2 {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        p {
            margin: 0 0 14px;
            color: var(--secondary-text);
        }

        p:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        ul {
            margin: 12px 0 0;
            padding-left: 24px;
            color: var(--secondary-text);
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        strong {
            color: var(--text);
        }

        a {
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        a:hover,
        a:focus {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .notice {
            padding: 18px 20px;
            background: var(--surface-light);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        footer {
            padding: 30px 16px 0;
            color: var(--secondary-text);
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .container {
                width: min(100% - 20px, 900px);
                padding: 20px 0;
            }

            .header {
                padding: 36px 20px;
                border-radius: 18px;
            }

            main {
                padding: 8px 20px 24px;
                border-radius: 18px;
            }

            section {
                padding: 22px 0;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header class="header">
            <p class="app-name">Poker Chip Counter</p>
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="effective-date">
                Effective date: July 30, 2026
            </p>
        </header>

        <main>
            <section>
                <h2>Introduction</h2>

                <p>
                    Poker Chip Counter, referred to in this policy as
                    the “App,” is developed and published by
                    <strong>Gega Studio</strong>.
                </p>

                <p>
                    This Privacy Policy explains how information is
                    handled when you use the App.
                </p>

                <div class="notice">
                    <p>
                        <strong>
                            Poker Chip Counter works offline and does
                            not collect, transmit, sell, or share your
                            personal information.
                        </strong>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Information stored in the App</h2>

                <p>
                    Information you enter into Poker Chip Counter may
                    include:
                </p>

                <ul>
                    <li>Game names</li>
                    <li>Player names</li>
                    <li>Poker-chip colors and denominations</li>
                    <li>Chip inventory and distribution information</li>
                    <li>Starting-stack values</li>
                    <li>Player stack values</li>
                    <li>Buy-ins and rebuys</li>
                    <li>Game and transaction history</li>
                    <li>App settings and preferences</li>
                </ul>

                <p>
                    This information is stored locally on your device.
                    It is not transmitted to Gega Studio or stored on
                    Gega Studio servers.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Information we collect</h2>

                <p>
                    Gega Studio does not collect personal information
                    through Poker Chip Counter.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The App does not require you to create an account,
                    register, sign in, or provide personal contact
                    information.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Internet connection</h2>

                <p>
                    An internet connection is not required to use the
                    App’s core features.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Game information and player information remain
                    locally stored on your device.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Data sharing</h2>

                <p>
                    Gega Studio does not sell, rent, trade, disclose,
                    or share your App data with third parties.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Advertising and analytics</h2>

                <p>
                    Poker Chip Counter does not display third-party
                    advertisements.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The App does not use advertising trackers or
                    analytics services to monitor your activity.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Permissions</h2>

                <p>
                    Poker Chip Counter does not require access to
                    sensitive device features such as:
                </p>

                <ul>
                    <li>Your precise location</li>
                    <li>Your contacts</li>
                    <li>Your camera</li>
                    <li>Your microphone</li>
                    <li>Your text messages</li>
                    <li>Your call history</li>
                    <li>Your photos or videos</li>
                </ul>

                <p>
                    A future version may request an optional permission
                    only when it is necessary for a clearly identified
                    feature. Any such change will be reflected in this
                    Privacy Policy.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Data retention and deletion</h2>

                <p>
                    Information entered into the App remains stored on
                    your device until you remove it.
                </p>

                <p>You can remove stored information by:</p>

                <ul>
                    <li>Deleting an individual saved game</li>
                    <li>Using the data-reset option in the App</li>
                    <li>Clearing the App’s data through Android settings</li>
                    <li>Uninstalling the App</li>
                </ul>

                <p>
                    Uninstalling the App or clearing its storage may
                    permanently delete locally stored game data.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Data security</h2>

                <p>
                    Because your information is stored locally, the
                    security of that information also depends on the
                    security of your device.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We recommend protecting your device with a password,
                    PIN, fingerprint, or another screen-lock method.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Device backups</h2>

                <p>
                    Depending on your Android device and backup
                    settings, the operating system or your device
                    provider may include App data in a device backup.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Such backups are managed by your device provider
                    and are subject to that provider’s privacy policy
                    and settings.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Children’s privacy</h2>

                <p>
                    Poker Chip Counter is not directed toward children
                    under the age of 13.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Gega Studio does not knowingly collect personal
                    information from children through the App.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Real-money gambling</h2>

                <p>
                    Poker Chip Counter is an organizational and
                    score-tracking utility for offline poker games.
                </p>

                <p>The App does not:</p>

                <ul>
                    <li>Offer real-money gambling</li>
                    <li>Accept or process wagers</li>
                    <li>Process deposits or withdrawals</li>
                    <li>Provide online poker games</li>
                    <li>Connect users with gambling operators</li>
                    <li>Promote casinos or gambling services</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Third-party services</h2>

                <p>
                    The current version of Poker Chip Counter does not
                    intentionally integrate third-party advertising,
                    analytics, account, or cloud-storage services.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>

                <p>
                    Gega Studio may update this Privacy Policy when the
                    App changes or when legal and operational
                    requirements change.
                </p>

                <p>
                    An updated effective date will be displayed at the
                    top of this page when changes are published.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Contact</h2>

                <p>
                    For questions about this Privacy Policy, contact:
                </p>

                <p>
                    <strong>Gega Studio</strong><br>
                    Email:
                    <a href="mailto:support@gegastudio.com">
                        support@gegastudio.com
                    </a>
                </p>
            </section>
        </main>

        <footer>
            © 2026 Gega Studio. All rights reserved.
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
